WEBVTT

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:17.320
Watch out!

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.450
Our HQ...

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:01.260
They're planning to destroy everything.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:09.340
Elfnein-chan!

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:14.330
No one controlled me...

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.580
Elfnein-chan!

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.330
Are you okay?

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.280
We need to get her first-aid!

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:23.390
Wake up...

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.890
Elfnein-chan! Elfnein-chan!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:24.470
<b>Episode 11 
It's All Right. Everything Is Just Fine</b>

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.510
Sorry, I was hungry.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.380
Yeah.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.150
<b>From: Kohinata Miku 
To: Hibiki 

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.780
Um... Dad...

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.150
What is it?

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:47.620
Do you really want to start over with Mom?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.340
Of course...

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:52.290
If you talk to her first, I'm sure she'll—

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:52.290
Then...

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:57.800
You should take the first step yourself.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.090
You're the one who ran out.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.740
You need to be the one who starts 
the process of coming back...

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:08.430
I don't want to do that.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.060
I'm scared, you know?

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.070
And more than anything, 
I have my pride as a man.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:22.270
I wanted to start over,

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:26.070
which is why I worked up the courage to see you.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:28.990
Hibiki...

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.950
So you need to have courage, too!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.480
But I just...

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.930
I can't do it alone.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:42.290
You aren't my dad anymore...

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.120
Once a family's been broken, it can't 
go back to the way it was.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.660
Wh-What is that?

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.500
The sky split?

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:29.260
The World Destructor System is set up.

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:34.270
I've fixed all the Château's functions 
in auto-drive mode.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.440
Well?

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:47.660
My left arm doesn't need Trigger Parts!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.780
Any relic I connect to can be 
controlled, any way I wish!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.200
The Autoscorers have brought

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.170
all the cursed melodies together.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.670
Now the world will be shattered into pieces.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:06.250
You want to shatter the world?

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:11.030
That is the problem my father left me.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.960
Carol... Live,

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.100
and know more of the world.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.440
I know!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.400
That's why I'm going to rip apart the world.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.250
If I dissect and analyze it,

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.810
I can understand all things!

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.000
In other words, ultimate knowledge?

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:32.060
Very well, my lady. What will 
you do with that knowledge?

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.850
Nothing.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.920
The problem my father left me

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.170
was to understand the world's mysteries.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.020
Nothing more.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:47.070
You have no dreams, my lady?

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.880
A hero dreams endlessly,

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.960
and shares dreams with others!

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.750
If you let yourself be satisfied with 
only those you've been given,

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.220
you'll never reach your full potential!

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.380
"Only," you said?

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:05.880
Yes.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:06.980
Hibiki-chan!

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.740
Communications are back on-line.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.740
I'll be brief.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.240
Carol's carefully laid plan

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.740
has entered its final stages.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.970
And Elfnein-kun was wounded in an enemy attack.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:24.390
We've given her first-aid, but her 
condition is dangerous.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:28.090
I'm fine...

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:31.260
So, let me stay here.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.800
Elfnein-chan!

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.890
We're heading to Tokyo as fast as we can go.

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.260
As the wielders gather,

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.400
we'll launch our counterattack.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.400
Until then...

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.820
Yes, I'll help with the evacuation,

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.750
and keep the damages from spreading.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:54.030
Dad, we need to help the eva—

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.150
How are you supposed

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.160
to sell videos like this to TV stations?

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:01.220
Dad...

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.220
You say they're "only" the dreams

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.790
I was given by my father?

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.010
I did, yes!

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:13.200
In fact, if you're acting like this, I don't know

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.550
if you can even solve this problem of yours.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:17.050
What?

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.910
Only a hero can exceed the universe's boundaries

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:22.910
and attain ultimate knowledge!

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:26.430
And a lady the size of an elementary school girl

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:28.090
is too small for a hero!

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:32.790
I guess I really am the only hero in the world.

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:35.320
No one is my equal!

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.630
It's really me.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.080
I'll be a hero.

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:41.080
And do what?

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.570
Of course, for humanity's sake,

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:45.830
I shall go beyond good and evil,

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.090
and control the Château de Tiffauges—

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.750
Oh, dear...

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.340
The ravings of a madman.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.640
A loon like you could never become a hero.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.650
You shouldn't use

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.100
an instrument like that...

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.450
The Château has been activated,

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.160
and the world-dissection program 
is running automatically.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:26.170
Thanks for your help, Dr. Ver.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:30.170
I shall dissect the world on my own!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.670
Don't do it!

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:32.670
No!

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.550
I dispatched him slightly earlier 
than planned, huh?

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:44.010
I won't stop.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.590
All obstacles to the plan

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:49.620
must be eliminated.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:52.250
I guess I shouldn't do it, huh?

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.340
Stop messing around, Dad!

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:58.450
Oh, that's your father?

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:01.360
Hibiki, someone's floating in the sky!

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.450
Carol-chan?

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:07.760
I wanted to start the apocalypse with your screams,

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:10.460
so I've forced this body here, 
though I'm still unused to it.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:19.470
Then that's really yours, after all?

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:20.920
Indeed.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.780
It is my castle, the Château de Tiffauges.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.100
And the dissection device that uses

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:31.730
the Alca-Noise to dissect the world.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.350
The world...

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.610
You talked about that before, right?

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.300
Back then, you whined about

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.400
how you couldn't fight.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.120
Do you still feel the same way?

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:50.750
My Gear!

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.630
I won't let you

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.760
touch your Gear!

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:03.910
I shall take up the problem my father left me.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.760
And with it, I shall stand against the world!

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:08.270
Your father left you...

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.520
Everyone should have something like that.

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:14.430
I've got nothing...

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.710
He never gave me anything.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.780
If you have nothing, then you 
won't be able to endure this!

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.470
Hibiki! Hey, Hibiki!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.860
I'll dissect you, before I dissect the world.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:36.550
Dad...

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.550
Please don't hurt me!

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.550
This is insane!

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:53.690
He ran! He abandoned his daughter,

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.510
stopped caring, and ran away!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.740
Stay back! Stay back!

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:05.740
Your father's a heck of a guy, huh?

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:10.300
My father didn't run, even at the end!

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.990
Hibiki, run away now!

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:15.280
If I want to fix our family,

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.750
I need you there!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.170
Dad!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.170
Dad...

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.100
Dad!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.110
This is nothing...

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.020
It's all right. Everything is just fine!

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:39.390
Daddy, are you okay?

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.070
It's all right. Everything is just fine!

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:48.350
<i>That's right.</i>

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:52.200
<i>That was what my dad always used to say.</i>

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.960
You weren't running?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.840
I was, but...

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.470
No matter how far I run,

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:05.970
I can't run away from the fact that I'm her father!

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:08.470
Dad...

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:11.330
Maybe I was no good...

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:13.660
But my daughter really was

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:17.050
trying to repair our broken family!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.730
She had the courage to try and face me!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:22.980
So I've decided to squeeze out

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.330
what little courage I have!

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:31.580
Hibiki, take this!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:42.890
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.030
Hibiki!

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.350
It's all right. Everything is just fine.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:57.020
Hibiki...

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:01.290
I got something important from you, Dad.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.010
I did!

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:12.410
It's all right. Everything is just fine.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.410
<b>Idiot                          Die</b>

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.910
It's all right. Everything is just fine.

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:20.390
Whenever I was about to give up,

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:22.630
you were always there for me, Dad.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.670
You were always protecting me!

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.680
Hibiki...

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:35.400
<i>There is a meaning in this mechanical arm,</i>

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:40.310
<i>in which a miracle dwells. (There is a meaning.)</i>

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:44.650
<i>It exists for my dream of a normal life,</i>

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:49.820
<i>for my dream of ordinary days. (For my dreams.)</i>

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:54.600
<i>To share this warmth with you! 
(This warmth is being shared.)</i>

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:59.830
<i>It doesn't have to be words! (Even if it isn't words.)</i>

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:04.250
<i>The answer of this fist, 
this answer without weapons.</i>

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.890
<i>Then I was right.</i>

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:09.260
<i>"One-Hit Love!" Blast them with a love song!</i>

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:09.260
<i>So that girl was Hibiki?</i>

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.640
<i>Believing in justice... (Believing in justice.)</i>

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.390
<i>All I ever did was run,</i>

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:14.180
<i>I'll clutch it tight. (I'll clutch it tight.)</i>

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:15.570
<i>but you kept doing your best,</i>

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:18.810
<i>Even if it's broken, we can start over!</i>

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:18.070
<i>no matter what happened.</i>

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.600
<i>Everything—</i>

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.440
Hibiki!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.780
Don't lose!

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:35.750
Hibiki, don't lose!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.490
<i>Everything's all right now, everything's just fine. 
(Everything's just fine.)</i>

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:41.600
<i>Our hearts are resounding together.</i>

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:46.740
<i>Even a little courage is still courage!</i>

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:52.980
<i>It becomes a love that can make me cry.</i>

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.430
<i>Hermes Trismegistus!</i>

00:15:56.970 --> 00:16:01.850
That won't stop me!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.380
Dad!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.930
If you're using your father to give you power,

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.200
I'll take that away from you first!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:22.460
Dad!

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.700
It's dangerous here! Hurry!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.060
Hibiki...

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:58.990
Let's stop this, Carol-chan!

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.750
I'm trying to accomplish my life's goal.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.020
I can't stop now!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:07.930
Even if I have to burn every memory I have!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:39.030
Daurdabla Burst Mode?

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:43.450
That light is like a Symphogear's.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:47.710
Now you'll learn that it isn't just the light!

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:54.050
What's this?

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:59.350
Combat zone energy pressure, rising rapidly!

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:01.940
Analysis complete.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:03.560
This waveform pattern...

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.060
It's phonic gain?

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.290
This is Carol's...

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:37.590
Its energy output is so high. It's like...

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:41.280
It isn't like anything... This is a Climax Song!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:45.260
She's using a Climax Song like it's nothing.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:47.900
Can alchemy really do anything?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:50.660
Then we'll use our S2CA.

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:51.410
Don't!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.040
Your body can't handle the strain!

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:55.610
But...

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.850
Tsubasa, look!

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:13.840
It's flashing.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:15.320
It's beating?

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:16.760
It's resonating?

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:21.260
The entire fortress is resonating with 
Carol's song like a tuning fork...

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.230
And it's amplifying her energy.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:43.770
The energy is radiating out,

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:46.080
overlapping the entire planet!

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:48.830
That orbit... It can't be...

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:50.860
The photosphere...

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.330
You can't come in here!

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:53.590
Please...

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:55.800
I don't want avert my eyes,

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.230
while my daughter is doing her best!

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.340
Let me see my daughter's... 
Let me see Hibiki's fight!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.810
Energy waves are converging 
around the dissection point!

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:05.850
It's leaving the surface!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.400
Oh, no!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.360
This is the world's dissection!

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:20.490
I won't let you!

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:28.870
If you had an Armed Gear, 
that might have worked.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:30.870
Maria!

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.620
I'll stop that huge device!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:44.810
We may be dependent on our LiNKER.

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:47.760
But there's no time limit on our bonds!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:57.020
You still won't be able to overcome 
the Château's defenses.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.480
You'll never be able to stop me!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.210
I have a song that will destroy the world!

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.980
They've made it inside the Château de Tiffauges.

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:36.980
Hibiki-chan and the others' vitals 
have gone way down!

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:53.000
I'll never look away again.

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:46.890
Mom?
